{"id":"vod_sn_39293","vodId":"39293","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"爱的魔法","name_cn":"爱的魔法","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/361185cd461e01b1bed12b258d8e5d56.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个存在着魔法的世界，式森和树（坂口大助 配音）是一个不合格的魔法师，虽然出生于魔法世家，但他一生可以使用魔法的次数仅为8次，一旦次数用完，施术者便会变成幽灵。平凡的和树准备就这样度过他平凡的一生，直到某天，一个自称是他妻子的女孩出现在了他的面前。此女名为间宫夕菜，曾经是和数的亲梅竹马，而她此次前来的目的，居然是想要继承和树体内质量极其优秀的遗传因子！就这样，和树和夕菜开始了快乐的同居生活。　　随着时间的推移，为了得到和树的因子，神城凛（猪口有佳 配音）、风椿玖里子（松冈由贵 配音）等长相可爱的女孩子接连出现在了和树的生活当中，一场因子争夺战轰轰烈烈的展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VEgZumUsxn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Dswm1n2hSJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fmLdJaUHSR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J1PRFKWAeY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qmse31ePp21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yzcpY3ydT81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yTAkCXunn21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P7teY8NQRe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0N15Txep5E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CJ0rDA3C4i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/badJbUyzvE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zdrR1AYgqR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nUbXBHb6PM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eHXn6BYdyS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","u